{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Early landing on a direct flight keeps the route to its destination",
  "contract": "During a flight the original action bar's leave button calls TaxiRequestEarlyLanding(), which Extensions.dll sends as the empty CMSG_TAXI_REQUEST_EARLY_LANDING (0x05F2), and the client disables the button without waiting for a reply. Retail's early landing ends the flight at the next discovered flight point on its route and drops the rest, unless that point is already the destination. The Gadgetzan - Freewind Post flight (TaxiPath 310, 430 copper) is one leg with no flight point between them. Expected: asked to land early, the flight keeps Freewind Post as its destination, stays in the air, lands at Freewind Post and pays nothing beyond the one leg.",
  "timeout_ms": 300000,
  "location": { "map": 1, "x": -7048.89, "y": -3780.36, "z": 10.19, "o": 0 },
  "players": [
    { "id": "traveler", "race": 2, "class": 1, "level": 60 }
  ],
